<title>FINLAND: Outokumpu details Jan-April production.</title>
<headline>Outokumpu details Jan-April production.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish mining and metals group Outokumpu Oy on Thursday gave the following figures for its January-April output of main products (tonnes):</p>
<p>					 Jan-Apr '97   Jan-Apr '96</p>
<p>BASE METALS</p>
<p>  Copper in concentrates	     7,500	  10,100</p>
<p>  Nickel in concentrates	     3,900	   4,700</p>
<p>  Zinc in concentrates		62,500	  63,100</p>
<p>  Lead in concentrates		16,900	  13,600</p>
<p>  Blister copper			56,500	  48,500</p>
<p>  Cathode copper			40,600	  35,600</p>
<p>  Nickel				  13,500	   9,300</p>
<p>  Zinc				    58,700	  59,900</p>
<p>Cathode copper/</p>
<p>  Zaldivar(50 pct)		    15,400	  12,200</p>
<p>STAINLESS STEEL</p>
<p>  Ferrochrome			   81,900	  80,200</p>
<p>  Steel slabs			  179,000	 144,000</p>
<p>Cold rolling mill production:</p>
<p>     Cold rolled products	  100,000	  82,400</p>
<p>     White hot strip		  44,000	  35,100</p>
<p>  Tubes and fittings		  11,200	   6,900</p>
<p>COPPER PRODUCTS</p>
<p>  Wrought copper products	  146,000	 142,000</p>
<p>Rolled products/Laminados</p>
<p>  Oviedo-Cordoba S.A.(50 pct)	4,400	   4,300</p>
<p>Annual average metal market prices:</p>
<p>				  1-4 '97	 1-4 '96  Change, pct</p>
<p> Copper	     $/lb	1.09	    1.17     -6.8</p>
<p>			FIM/kg   12.03	   11.80     +1.9</p>
<p> Nickel	     $/lb	3.40	    3.64     -6.6</p>
<p>			FIM/kg   37.44	   36.79     +1.8</p>
<p> Zinc		 $/lb	0.54	    0.47    +14.9</p>
<p>			FIM/kg    5.94	    4.77    +24.5</p>
<p> Ferrochrome	$/lb	0.43	    0.64    -32.8</p>
<p>  (Cr-content)    FIM/kg    4.71	    6.51    -27.6</p>
<p> Stainless Steel  DEM/kg    2.96	    3.27     -9.5</p>
<p>			FIM/kg    8.82	   10.12    -12.8</p>
<p>Copper, nickel and zinc: LME cash quotations converted into USD/lb. Estimated total stocks (CRU, Outokumpu).</p>
<p>Ferrochrome: Metal Bulletin - lumpy Cr charge, basis 52 pct, free market.</p>
<p>Stainless Steel: CRU - German transaction price and conversion margin (2 mm cold rolled 304 sheet)</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
